# Torgal, A Fine Hound: "that creature enters with an additional +1/+1 counter on it for each Dog and/or Wolf you control" counts the Dogs as
# well as the Wolves, and only its controller's (CR 109.5). Bot1 has Torgal (a Wolf) and its own Warclamp Mastiff (a Dog); Bot2 has a
# Warclamp Mastiff too. On turn 3 Torgal's mana pays for Elite Vanguard, Bot1's first Human creature spell of the turn: it enters with two
# counters (Torgal and Bot1's Mastiff) - not one (the Wolf alone) and not three (Bot2's Dog counted).

